-that-look-good-and-work">Stations That Look Good and Work</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#6-a-coffee-corner-on-a-tray">6. A Coffee Corner on a Tray</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#7-a-cookbook-stand">7. A Cookbook Stand</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#8-herbs-on-the-windowsill">8. Herbs on the Windowsill</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#9-warm-light-on-the-counter">9. Warm Light on the Counter</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#decor-above-and-around-the-counter">Decor Above and Around the Counter</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#10-style-open-shelves-above-the-counter">10. Style Open Shelves Above the Counter</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#11-lean-art-on-the-counter">11. Lean Art on the Counter</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#12-a-trailing-plant-up-high">12. A Trailing Plant Up High</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#13-hide-the-appliances-you-rarely-use">13. Hide the Appliances You Rarely Use</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#island-and-smallkitchen-ideas">Island and Small-Kitchen Ideas</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#14-one-bowl-and-one-board-on-the-island">14. One Bowl and One Board on the Island</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#15-style-one-corner-only-in-a-small-kitchen">15. Style One Corner Only in a Small Kitchen</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#seasonal-kitchen-counter-decor">Seasonal Kitchen Counter Decor</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#16-swap-one-grouping-each-season">16. Swap One Grouping Each Season</a></li></ul></li><li><a class=